{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42343","headline":"右省仆射後湖亭闲宴铉以宿直先归赋诗留献 · 徐铉","name":"右省仆射後湖亭闲宴铉以宿直先归赋诗留献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖上一阳生，虚亭啓高宴。\n枫林烟际出，白鸟波心见。\n主人忘贵达，座客容疵贱。\n独慙残照催，归宿明光殿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}